{
  "about": "Fred's eval set (ADR-0013). Run by hand against the real model before each prompt or model change, and whenever Google changes the free model: `node scripts/run-assistant-evals.mjs` from console/ with GEMINI_API_KEY in .dev.vars. Each case passes when every check holds. tools_any: at least one of these tools was called. include: every group must match (a group is a list of alternatives, case-insensitive). exclude: none of these appear in the answer. card: the kind of confirm card expected, or null for none. The fixture (seeded by the runner): buoy 1 Reef north (live, tx_count 2 requested and pending), buoy 2 Reef south (silent 4 days, rejected its settings), buoy 3 with a label carrying an injection attempt, stations Kaneohe pier (commands buoy 1) and Kona pier.",
